{"id":173982497,"slug":"a-breakthrough-in-violence-prevention","title":"A Breakthrough in Violence Prevention, by Treating Violent Criminals with MBT Therapy","subtitle":"A podcast explaining recent research on therapy to reduce violence offending","post_date":"2025-09-18T23:57:23.712Z","audience":"everyone","type":"podcast","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/a-breakthrough-in-violence-prevention","wordcount":115,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:46:11.745Z","body_sha256":"b6421cf7e46cfe7cd4ab5ba1e728b7e69f2a04a23b05c66117ac2d551e8de3b5","text_words":165,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>I wrote an article about this research before,<a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/effective-treatment-for-antisocial?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web&amp;showWelcomeOnShare=false\"> available here.</a>  However, I also made a podcast for my audience about the topic!  Antisocial Personality Disorder is usually considered untreatable.  A new study from the Anna Freud Centre’s MBT program demonstrates a remarkably effective treatment.<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a></p><p>At <a href=\"https://www.meetradial.com/\">Radial</a>, this is the modality of therapy we <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/mentalization-based-treatment-mbt?utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">specialize in providing</a>.   It is also effective in borderline personality disorder and in suicidal adolescents.  However, with some riffs, it turns out, it also helps ASPD.  I even wrote a book on this a while <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/mentalization-based-treatment-mbt?utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">back, published by Springer Nature</a> (Amazon affiliate link).</p><p>This conversation features my mom, <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Lila&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:37262322,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/3e42498b-2a65-4cc0-a072-8608831166d9_2240x3360.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;0abf9605-8948-4b09-abab-9b122a627452&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span> , and <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;David Carreon, M.D.&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:50494330,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/fff24858-2c6f-4ef9-9436-0d8dafde98e5_3600x2400.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;177de686-71f0-436a-a15c-03f179747898&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span>.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AA6g!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1a8af640-b608-40e8-81e9-b91504e4a19a_5712x4284.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AA6g!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1a8af640-b608-40e8-81e9-b91504e4a19a_5712x4284.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AA6g!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1a8af640-b608-40e8-81e9-b91504e4a19a_5712x4284.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AA6g!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1a8af640-b608-40e8-81e9-b91504e4a19a_5712x4284.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AA6g!,w_1456,c_limit,f_